OL,3,GNEWSAStudent who stabbed housemate 30
OL,4,Atimes admits murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, Coughlan, of Cleve Road,
OL,7,FFilton, has now changed his plea to
OL,8,Fguilty and will be sentenced for murder
OL,9,Fon Wednesday.
